# Force LF line endings for shell scripts regardless of platform checkout settings.
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true renormalizes .sh files to
# CRLF, turning `#!/bin/sh` into `#!/bin/sh\r` — which fails as a bad interpreter
# inside Linux Docker containers (see docker-entrypoint.sh, run at container start).
*.sh text eol=lf
